    {
      "depth": 2,
      "text": "Publish the stream with OpenTAK ICU.",
      "id": "publish-the-stream-with-opentak-icu"
    }
  ],
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<h2 id=\"publish-the-stream-with-opentak-icu\"><a href=\"#publish-the-stream-with-opentak-icu\">Publish the stream with OpenTAK ICU.</a></h2>"
    },
    {
      "type": "slideset",
      "source": "legacy",
      "slides": [
        {
          "title": "Open Deploy App - MTX",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Open Deloy App MTX</li>\n<li>Select \"+ Add\"</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX - Start a stream 1",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Open OpenTAK ICU dropdown</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/6c688161563357e5.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2007
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "MTX - Start a stream 2",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Select \"Auto import settings to OpenTAK_ICU\"</li>\n<li>OpenTAK ICU opens in your device</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b97b49cb1a80bfde.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2006
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenTAK ICU - Instructions 1",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Welcome page opens if you haven't opened OpenTAK ICU before it will ask for permissions, grand it everything it asks</li>\n<li>Swipe left or click the \">\" to continue</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/9c4a8be9656f88c0.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2177
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenTAK ICU - Instructions 2",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Your streaming configuration will be shown</li>\n<li>Check the config is corret. (Mainly the server is the one you want)</li>\n<li>Click \"Import\" be carefull not to swipe</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/7c693aed82153c62.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2177
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenTAK ICU - Instructions 3",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>Check you also get the \"Settings Updated Successfully\"</li>\n<li>If not return back and press \"Import\" again</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/0a4ec50c875e3f61.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2177
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenTAK ICU - Streaming 1",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>The basic view of OpenTAK ICU</li>\n<li>To stream choose the \"Record Button\"</li>\n<li>To change settings manually choose the \"Gear\" icon</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/b23a282d7658326a.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2256
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "OpenTAK ICU - Streaming 2",
          "layout": "image-left",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>When stream starts you get a notification \"Connection success\"</li>\n<li>If you don't get a notification and the bitrate doesn't change try importing the settings again and check your internet connection</li>\n<li>You can stop the stream from \"Stop\" button</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": [
            {
              "src": "/content/images/en/attachments/62f1db708a50e846.webp",
              "width": 1080,
              "height": 2256
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "title": "You now know how to stream",
          "layout": "text",
          "html": "<ul>\n<li>You can close this guide.</li>\n</ul>",
          "images": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "html",
      "html": "<p>Once you have started the stream, continue to the section <a href=\"/doc/9c3d844b-ebb7-453c-9d30-7bab0891f66e\">Watch Stream</a></p>"
    }
  ]
}
